164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (Relief Mission Foundation is a registered charitable foundation dedicated to transforming the lives of children and those in need. Based in Jaipur, our mission is to build lasting relationships between individuals and communities to generate the funds necessary to ensure the well-being of children and vulnerable populations. We work closely with children, attending to their daily needs, and strive to provide them with a brighter future. Our foundation is committed to creating opportunities for these children to live healthier, happier lives, giving them a renewed sense of purpose and hope. Your support can make a profound difference. Together, we can change the way these children live and offer them a new meaning to their lives. At Relief Mission Foundation, we believe in the power of collective action to uplift communities and empower the most vulnerable among us. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
