<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 110 0 R
/E (During my Human Resource Internship at Relief Mission Foundation, my main project focused on optimizing candidate screening, scheduling, and onboarding workflows. I was responsible for drafting targeted job descriptions, creating promotional graphic materials using Canva, and actively publishing vacancies across platforms like LinkedIn and WhatsApp. Additionally, I maintained centralized applicant data, managed recruitment pipelines in Excel master sheets, and conducted preliminary screenings to identify top talent for key roles.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
